      "committer_account_type": "User",
      "message": "ci: upgrade agentic workflows to gh-aw v0.76.1\n\nUpgraded the GitHub Agentic Workflows infrastructure from gh-aw v0.51.6 to\nv0.76.1 via `gh aw upgrade` + `gh aw update`.\n\nUpdated workflows:\n- `daily-doc-updater.md`: synced to upstream\n  github/gh-aw@51c1a43, adopting new fields (imports, emoji, noop,\n  protected-files, cli-proxy, min-integrity: approved, mode: gh-proxy).\n  Preserved local cron `54 1 * * 1-4` and `engine: copilot`.\n- `daily-repo-status.md`: upstream source moved to\n  githubnext/agentics/workflows/repo-status.md@main; restored local cron\n  `54 2 * * 1-4` (Mon-Thu) after the clean replace.\n\nAdded:\n- `.github/agents/agentic-workflows.agent.md` — dispatcher agent.\n- `.github/aw/actions-lock.json` — pinned action and container versions.\n- `.github/workflows/agentics-maintenance.yml` — auto-generated\n  maintenance jobs (triggered by `expires: 1d` on doc-updater).\n- `.github/workflows/copilot-setup-steps.yml` — Copilot agent setup.\n- `.github/workflows/shared/{github-guard-policy,otlp,noop-reminder}.md`\n  — shared imports required by the updated daily-doc-updater.\n\nBoth workflows pass `gh aw compile` and `gh aw validate` cleanly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
