      "message": "ci: pin daily-repo-status Copilot model to gpt-5-mini\n\nThe Repo Status agentic workflow defaulted to claude-sonnet-4.6, which is\nnot available on the Copilot Pro/Education subscription tier, producing\n\"400 The requested model is not supported\" failures. Pin the engine to the\nCopilot-supported gpt-5-mini model in the frontmatter and recompile the\nlock file (compiler v0.76.1, unchanged) so only the model fields change.\n\nCloses #547\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
